OL,3,GNEWSANo 'imminent catastrophe' signs
OL,4,Abefore gas blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors at a trial over a fatal gas
OL,7,Fexplosion in a block of flats in Jersey
OL,8,Fhave been told "nothing about the
OL,9,Fnetwork suggested an imminent
OL,10,Fcatastrophe".
OL,12,FTen people died as a result of the
OL,13,Fexplosion near Haut du Mont flats in
OL,14,Fthe early hours of 10 December 2022.
OL,16,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,17,Fand Lee Ward all deny 10 counts of
OL,18,Fgross negligence manslaughter, while
OL,19,FIsland Energy has pleaded not guilty to
OL,20,Fhealth and safety breaches.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
