OL,3,GNEWSANo 'imminent catastrophe' signs
OL,4,Abefore gas blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn their closing remarks at Jersey
OL,7,FRoyal Court, defence lawyers for
OL,8,FArmstrong, Wright and Ward asked the
OL,9,Fjury to find their clients not guilty,
OL,10,Facknowledging it had been a "sad and
OL,11,Ftragic" case.
